    description: "A comprehensive understanding of the principles of magic, especially ritual magic and power spells. Recovers P.P.E. at 10 per hour of rest or sleep, 15 per hour of meditation. Impervious to possession. Draws extra P.P.E. from ley lines, nexus points, people and ritual blood sacrifice the same as a Ley Line Walker. A maximum of 2D4+2 additional spells can be learned or purchased the same as the Ley Line Walker, though High Magi rarely pursue magic outside creation and building."
